a bambina, appare continuamente in vari punti del palazzo.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Don't let the water reach you.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2002-01-19","status":"Released","rating":6.823,"ratingCount":779,"genres":["Horror","Mistero","Thriller"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"101m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":71641,"name":"Hitomi Kuroki","role":"Yoshimi Matsubara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4rGUnsCPTkgWTOq6CWfkD3BT1sl.jpg"},{"id":71644,"name":"Rio Kanno","role":"Young Ikuko Matsubara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5H4tWYZGCex99MYzKO1EZ8CAzUp.jpg"},{"id":71642,"name":"Mirei Oguchi","role":"Mitsuko Kawai"},{"id":71643,"name":"Asami Mizukawa","role":"Ikuko Hamada","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s65mobAWexnr8QroTXvJUeem6o1.jpg"},{"id":58449,"name":"Fumiyo Kohinata","role":"Kunio Hamada","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP01PV514ZjybXfNpfv91pWxKal.jpg"},{"id":68706,"name":"Yuu Tokui","role":"Ota","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rE5vKobisonYFmZLGx2As1tIMqL.jpg"},{"id":552518,"name":"Isao Yatsu","role":"Kamiya","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pUwpT9TZsN0gsDM62LdcijmbbrT.jpg"},{"id":18059,"name":"Shigemitsu Ogi","role":"Kishida","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6p9qTH1TVCbiix1yn22l0T8kS5c.jpg"},{"id":555020,"name":"Maiko Asano","role":"Young Yoshimi's Teacher"},{"id":3257171,"name":"Yukiko Ikari","role":"Young Yoshimi"},{"id":555155,"name":"Shinji Nomura","role":"Mediator","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5KbykCj63cYOt4t2B186eqNau0t.jpg"},{"id":554604,"name":"Kiriko Shimizu","role":"Mediator","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wNNlcsSkUY3LdsYDwkzOTDIKgcn.jpg"},{"id":1906051,"name":"Teruko Hanahara","role":"Old Lady"},{"id":1096220,"name":"Youko Yasuda","role":"Old Lady"},{"id":3572813,"name":"Shichirou Gou","role":"Nishioka"},{"id":1056614,"name":"Chisako Hara","role":"Kayo","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u3GTSkPGvzDDBSPUKzLSfwAfsPG.jpg"},{"id":1119732,"name":"Tōru Shinagawa","role":"Kindergarten Principal","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z2OdQ8Gs6u5otdN2kg0AFeIOTKJ.jpg"},{"id":2660799,"name":"Rie Hagiwara","role":"Nursery Teacher"},{"id":3508541,"name":"Erika Hatanaka","role":"Nursery Teacher"},{"id":3508542,"name":"Youko Hujimoto"},{"id":3508543,"name":"Hibiki Izawa"},{"id":2660463,"name":"Erika Kuroishi","role":"Kiyomi"},{"id":20327,"name":"Tarō Suwa","role":"Boss of Yoshimi Matsubara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wLbAf2eRaMpGVH4tz0OMvXM2eS3.jpg"},{"id":2200633,"name":"Minako Tsuda"},{"id":130653,"name":"Chihiro Ohtsuka","role":"Reiko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aI3RmcNSFhhObRebtPeWlYL6pH5.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Dark Water","overview":"Dopo aver ottenuto l'affidamento di sua figlia Ikuko, Yoshimi, da poco divorziata, si trasferisce con la bambina in un grosso palazzo in periferia. Strani eventi iniziano presto a verificarsi: dal soffitto cola inspiegabimente, e insistentemente, dell'acqua, e una borsetta rossa, evidentemente appartenente a una bambina, appare continuamente in vari punti del palazzo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dark Water","overview":"A woman in the midst of an unpleasant divorce moves to an eerie apartment building with her young daughter. The ceiling of their apartment has a dark and active leak.","tagline":"Don't let the water reach you."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"仄暗い水の底から","overview":"離婚調停中であり、娘の郁子の親権を夫邦夫と争っている淑美は生活を立て直そうと、郁子と一緒に新しいマンションに引っ越す。しかし、そこは雨漏りが酷い、水道水が不味い、上階の子供の足音がよく響くなど不具合が多く、また彼女は何か不穏なものを感じていた。  ある日、淑美は屋上で、赤い子供用バッグ（mimikoバッグ）を見つけ、それがきっかけで郁子と同じ幼稚園に通っていた少女・河合美津子が2年前から行方不明になっているのを知る。美津子は父と共に、淑美たちの真上の部屋に住んでいて、行方不明になったときには似たバッグをかけていた。  バッグは落とし物としてマンション管理人に届け、捨てられたことを確認するが、後日また屋上で同じものが見つかった。娘の郁子はバッグが気になるようで、また、見えない女の子と会話する奇行が見られるようになった。淑美は、美津子の霊が郁子を連れ去ろうとしているのではないかと恐慌に陥り、一度はマンションを出る決意する。","tagline":"ずっとずっと いっしょだよね、ママ。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hAZLRGIt9mDCxA3nU0V5ws82bnL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDmh55o2VOiUZEjHG0wFN3y36tT.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":12205,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hAZLRGIt9mDCxA3nU0V5ws82bnL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hAZLRGIt9mDCxA3nU0V5ws82bnL.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hAZLRGIt9mDCxA3nU0V5ws82bnL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hAZLRGIt9mDCxA3nU0V5ws82bnL.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8VFXb8DQfdojgR88o6PrcWd7KFz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8VFXb8DQfdojgR88o6PrcWd7KFz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dZK7juLHa2aMkalm7C3SbWqN9Yz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dZK7juLHa2aMkalm7C3SbWqN9Yz.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bXdAEtdk7rzydSPGSIuSjEetGvf.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bXdAEtdk7rzydSPGSIuSjEetGvf.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uXofghURyeZPyNruVmoqb3HYd6E.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uXofghURyeZPyNruVmoqb3HYd6E.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iSq6J55RFLfwcceDKxYtMjOr1sz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iSq6J55RFLfwcceDKxY